    "sub_name": "通訊電子學",
    "sub_ename": "COMMUNICATION ELECTRONICS",
    "describe_ch": "讓學生了解通訊系統架構與調變技術，熟悉類比通訊與數位通訊系統使用之各個電子電路，並了解電路等之特性、原理及應用。",
    "describe_eh": "To enable students to understand the characteristics of the communication system and modulation technique, to be familiar with the circuits used in digital and analog communication system, and to know the characteristics, theorems and applications of the circuits.",
